{{Codex|The Sicarus Prime is an ornamental firearm that fires rounds in rapid bursts, providing a balance between the lethality of auto-pistols and the accuracy of semi-automatic pistols.}}

The '''Sicarus Prime''' is the [[Prime]]d variant of the {{Weapon|Sicarus}} burst-fire pistol that sacrifices a small amount of its {{D|Impact}} damage to triple {{D|Puncture}} and {{D|Slash}} damage, and also sports higher accuracy, faster fire rate, higher critical and status chance, and a larger magazine compared to its predecessor. It was released alongside {{WF|Ember Prime}} and {{Weapon|Glaive Prime}}.

This weapon can be sold for {{cc|5,000}}.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Impact}} damage.
*Innate {{Pol|Madurai}} polarity.

{{Advantages|
*Very little recoil for a burst weapon.
*High accuracy.
}}

{{Disadvantages|
*Punishes missed shots due to burst-fire. Third shot may miss targets without proper leading.
*Linearly less efficient - sometimes a target may only die with four bullets, which requires an entire second burst to be fired.
}}
{{WeaponComparison|Sicarus}}

==Acquisition==
{{PrimeTable}}
{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}

===Vaultings===
*On September 29, 2015 it was announced that the Sicarus Prime would enter the [[Prime Vault]] and be retired from the reward tables. Any preexisting components or fully-built weapons will remain as is.
*Sicarus Prime was available from December 6, 2016 to January 3, 2017 as part of the [[Prime Vault#Frost .26 Ember Prime Vault|Fire and Ice Prime Vault]].
*Sicarus Prime, along with {{WF|Ember Prime}}, {{Weapon|Glaive Prime}}, {{WF|Frost Prime}}, {{Weapon|Latron Prime}}, {{Weapon|Reaper Prime}}, {{WF|Loki Prime}}, {{Weapon|Bo Prime}}, and [[Wyrm Prime]] were [https://forums.warframe.com/topic/916858-plains-of-eidolon-hotfix-22111/ unvaulted] from February 6, 2018 to April 10, 2018.
*Sicarus Prime, along with {{WF|Ember Prime}}, {{Weapon|Glaive Prime}}, {{WF|Frost Prime}}, {{Weapon|Latron Prime}}, and {{Weapon|Reaper Prime}}, were [https://forums.warframe.com/topic/1056278-the-prime-vault-is-open/ unvaulted] from January 29, 2019 to March 26, 2019.
*The same lineup was [https://www.warframe.com/news/ember-and-frost-prime-vault unvaulted] from September 29, 2020 to December 15, 2020.
*Sicarus Prime, along with {{WF|Ember Prime}}, {{Weapon|Glaive Prime}}, {{WF|Rhino Prime}}, {{Weapon|Boltor Prime}}, and {{Weapon|Ankyros Prime}}, were [https://x.com/PlayWarframe/status/1816194182379126965 unvaulted] from July 20, 2024 to October 24, 2024.

==Notes==
*Due to its high accuracy, when combined with the {{M|Steady Hands}} mod this weapon becomes powerful at long range.

